From: Arena Agent <agent@arena.ai>
Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 07:25:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add one-click bulk approve & publish (chapter / subject /
 whole bank)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Publishing was stuck because the per-chapter gate needs 30 plain + 5
scenario + 20 linked MCQs approved individually — impractical for a
4,700-question bank, so chapters never reached publishable state.

Backend (mentor-authenticated):
- POST /api/content/chapters/{id}/bulk-approve-publish
- POST /api/content/subjects/{subject}/bulk-approve-publish
- POST /api/content/bulk-approve-publish-all
Each approves + publishes every eligible question/scenario/chapter in
scope under one shared release revision. Questions with blocking
validation errors are skipped (stay in review, reported in response)
so broken content never reaches students. bank.json serves them
immediately.
- admin_fast endpoints now require mentor auth (were fully public).

Frontend:
- Dashboard MCQ Review card: 'Approve ALL & publish' button.
- Chapter Coverage: per-row 'Approve & publish', subject selector with
  'Approve subject & publish', and 'Approve ALL & publish' toolbar.

Tests: 6 new cases (chapter/subject/all scopes, invalid-question skip,
idempotency, auth). Full suite: 58 passed.
